# {{NAME}} Workspace

This is a **workspace shell**, not a project. It exists so the following repos can be worked on side-by-side from one Claude Code session:

{{REPO_LIST}}

## Layout

- Each sub-repo above lives at the workspace root and has its own git history. **Authoritative conventions live in each sub-repo's own `CLAUDE.md`** — read those when working inside that repo.
- `.claude/agents|commands|skills|hooks/` — symlinks into each sub-repo, regenerated by `./bootstrap.sh`. Never edit these symlinks directly; edit the real file in the relevant sub-repo.
- `workspace.conf` — declares which sub-repos belong to this workspace. Edit + rerun `./bootstrap.sh` to add or remove a repo.

## Working across repos

- For a single-repo task, treat that sub-repo as cwd in spirit and follow its own `CLAUDE.md`. Use the matching agent if the sub-repo defines one.
- For tasks that touch multiple sub-repos, make changes in each sub-repo's working tree and commit/push from each one separately. **This shell never tracks changes inside the sub-repos** (they are gitignored here).

## When agents change

If an agent / command / skill / hook is added, renamed, or removed inside a sub-repo, run `./bootstrap.sh` again — it's idempotent and prunes stale symlinks.
